<human_speech><green>Two adversaries this time. They are not allies. We did not train them to cooperate.<\green><blue>Yet.<\blue><green>Every seat fights every other seat. Their ships will fight each other on the way to you. Let them.<\green><blue>Take the survivor, <\blue><golden><shining>Blotto<\golden><\shining><blue>, not the pair.<\blue><\human_speech>
